{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51933","headline":"凤台云母（所居春冈，地产云母。尝梦老人授服饵丹法，渐觉身轻健。有诗曰〖见下〗。後果有凤来集其上，遂改名凤台云。） · 何仙姑","name":"凤台云母（所居春冈，地产云母。尝梦老人授服饵丹法，渐觉身轻健。有诗曰〖见下〗。後果有凤来集其上，遂改名凤台云。）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凤台云母似天花，链作芙蓉白云芽。\n笑杀狂游勾漏令，更从何处觅丹砂？。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"何仙姑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51933.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51933","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}